  "subtitle": "Roman grilled lamb cutlets",
  "excerpt": "Scottadito means 'burn your fingers' -- these lamb cutlets are meant to be picked up and eaten while still hot. They are marinated in garlic, rosemary and lemon, then grilled fast over very high heat until charred on the outside and pink within.",
