        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Get the pan or grill very hot before the lamb goes in. These cook in 3 to 4 minutes per side. A quick sear is what you want -- not a slow braise. Rest for 5 minutes so the juices redistribute."
          }
        ]
      },
